==Behind the scenes==
The [[Fantasy Flight Games]] sourcebook ''[[Endless Vigil]]'' incorrectly identifies [[Scipio]] as the Muun homeworld,<ref name="Endless">''[[Endless Vigil]]''</ref> conflicting with [[Star Wars: Build the Millennium Falcon 45|''Star Wars: Build the Millennium Falcon'' 45]]<ref name="BMF45" /> and Muunilinst's original history in the [[Star Wars Legends|''Star Wars'' Legends]] continuity.<ref name="UAA">''[[Ultimate Alien Anthology]]''</ref>

